  <item>
    <title>Vol.19 新嘉宾驾到，伍佰的浪人情歌也没她这么“浪”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f68c55623bc78c3997ac0e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f68c55623bc78c3997ac0e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Apr 2025 15:23:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo58z4KER01GmvIxUZJCz6RC3zLg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>| 本期主题 |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《杨枝甘露》又来新嘉宾啦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期来做客的嘉宾很特别，身份很多，与两位主播的关系也很复杂：段干木的前同事、老梁的前房东、法学背景的公关/金融从业者、香港浪人、资深美漂，以及舟山岛岛主、香格里拉红酒庄未来庄主……</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为两位博主的同龄人（勉强算同龄，其实人家要年轻几岁），她活出了两位博主内心一直很向往但又始终没做到的样子，从舟山来到上海，又一路出走香港、美国，最后跑到香格里拉去种葡萄。她总能勇敢地走出舒适圈，随心所欲地闯荡世界，哪怕一次次跌到归零，也能一次次在原地爬起。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，三位老友在阔别十几年后再次相聚于上海，不知不觉就聊了两个多小时。虽然时间略长，开头的剪辑还一不小心掉了链子，但我们依然扶墙推荐，大家一定坚持听完，希望我们都能够借一借这位江浙沪独生女的勇气，早日活成自己理想中的样子。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lohk9UJNQ2P4AkDmU5hKunsh06Gz.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpSD_qrDx0B8l5opc_x8So6DqJfS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>| 本期主播 |</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj67gQ_k33v1yKlKnlFchPSMZeXc.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>| 时间轴 |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">6:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;嘉宾Rebecca给自己的标签：自由与归零</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="609">10:09</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;什么？段干木人没去硅谷，她的传说却已在硅谷流传？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="893">14:53</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;在香港学会的第一课：工作只是工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;原来本期嘉宾是一位专割股民韭菜的“中环之狼”！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1462">24:22</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;为什么初到美国语言不通，却要刻意避开老乡文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;在美国租房买车，和美剧里演的不一样啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2118">35:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;在纽约看sleep no more简直是大开眼界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;法学生圆梦了，竟然在美国当了一次陪审员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2624">43:44</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;在波浪谷和一位导游小哥哥的特别缘分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3570">59:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;想知道在美国工作有多不卷吗？听完不要太羡慕~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5149">85:49</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;一年比一年狼狈的感恩节都是怎么过的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5879">97:59</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;从归国抉择谈故土情怀与亚裔的亲情重量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6404">106:44</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;去香格里拉买地，来自岛主的DNA觉醒</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| 本期音乐 |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：Keyoung Fresh-Lovesickness.</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| 哪里还能听 |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/苹果Podcast上收听，搜索“杨枝甘露”即可。</span></p><span></span><p><span>送上我们播客RSS：</span><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jwcb9y9vba78" data-url="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jwcb9y9vba78"><span>https://feed.xyzfm.space/jwcb9y9vba78</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| 制作 |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>录制/剪辑：老梁</span></p><span></span><p><span>SN：段干木</span></p>]]></description>
