  <item>
    <title>Vol.12 人在旅途| 在冰岛追极光，徒步找飞机残骸，撩冰岛马，是怎样一种体验？（下集）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/649b0131a5b2b405c6db9d72</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">649b0131a5b2b405c6db9d72</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Jun 2023 15:33:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><br></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fke7Ksn6NRLZnNBCnJO2Gv5hIpgi.jpg"></figure><span></span><h2><span>| 本期主题 |</span></h2><span></span><p><span>上一期，两位主播为你们带来了冰岛环岛之旅的上半集，相信那冰天雪地的美好“画面”还留在你脑海里，勾引着你前往。而这一集，我们则继续带来环岛自驾之旅剩下的故事。这里头，有黑沙滩上神秘的飞机残骸，有让人哭笑不得的各种瀑布，有让徐志胜都自愧不如的冰岛马，还有我们的终极大礼物——极光啊！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs1Nz8HpumZaPQV8AfLGq2cM4VOE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk4JwNJp6dvkpULwRA3MOELAWy6z.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjt952uMv0f9eOjapXhZCerNCdt1.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuBeFeWrB1VxCapFeWMNao5fwiBw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>| 本期主播 |</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuBXBSndr4ReLrg4wUX_NLzCutrU.jpg"></figure><span></span><h2><span>| 本期对应老梁的游记 |</span></h2><span></span><p><a href="https://www.mafengwo.cn/i/23958309.html" data-url="https://www.mafengwo.cn/i/23958309.html"><span>冰岛冬季环岛 | 世界若有尽头，应是一首孤独的蓝色散文诗,冰岛旅游攻略 - 马蜂窝 (mafengwo.cn)</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>| 本期音乐 |</span></h2><span></span><p><span>José González-《Stay Alive》</span></p><span></span><p><span>间奏《Dreams Today》</span></p><span></span><h2><span>| 哪里还能听 |</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小宇宙/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/苹果Podcast上收听，搜索“杨枝甘露”即可。</span></p><span></span><p><span>送上我们播客RSS：</span><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jwcb9y9vba78" data-url="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jwcb9y9vba78"><span>https://feed.xyzfm.space/jwcb9y9vba78</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>| 后期制作 |</span></h2><span></span><p><span>录制/剪辑/SN：“精神冰岛人”老梁</span></p>]]></description>
