  <item>
    <title>VOL.9 徘徊在骨科门口的两位中年人入坑陆冲的故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6474c37b1672628240650adb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6474c37b1672628240650adb</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 May 2023 15:23:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>| 本期主题 |</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlOv6pckm8sUKtELH9jk3qh2AIaY.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>两个奔五的中年人，一个刚刚经历跟腱断裂的折磨，疼痛还历历在目；一个天生前庭发育不良，原地转个圈都忍不住要晕倒；却心血来潮开始挑战「滑板」这个离骨科很近的运动，而且竟然成功了。哪里来的胆量啊？！本期就来听两位主播现身说法……</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FowzpNNpOTmJS9V3-YiaO3ZReaWZ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>先发个预告：《杨枝甘露》旅行番外要来啦！N多目的地主题，欢迎大家提前来翻牌~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| 本期主播 |</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuBXBSndr4ReLrg4wUX_NLzCutrU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>| 时间轴 |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 为什么进了陆冲的坑？一切源自老梁那该死的胜负心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 搞不懂陆冲板，就“买懂”它</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="943">15:43</a> 不要放弃自己，你终将征服所谓的“不可能”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1282">21:22</a> 玩滑板带来的中年偶像光环，亲人们懂吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1435">23:55</a> 敲黑板：单身的朋友们快去玩滑板吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2356">39:16</a> 囧，某人滑啊滑果然滑进了骨科</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2654">44:14</a> 回忆那些因运动受过的伤，都是泪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3601">60:01</a> 运动这么容易受伤，为什么还偏向虎山行？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3607">60:07</a> 关于陆冲的快问快答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4203">70:03</a> 最后梁叔送出的选购陆冲板的小彩蛋</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| 本期音乐 |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>结尾歌曲：Tessa Violet - Crush</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| 哪里还能听 |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/苹果Podcast上收听，搜索“杨枝甘露”即可。</span></p><span></span><p><span>送上我们播客RSS：</span><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jwcb9y9vba78" data-url="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jwcb9y9vba78"><span>https://feed.xyzfm.space/jwcb9y9vba78</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| 后期制作 |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>录制/剪辑：陆冲入门包教会教练老梁</span></p><span></span><p><span>SN：中年滑板队大师姐段干木</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ls112QI-gWhsMcP8Y94wQd5ZiiEF.m4a" length="108779508" type="audio/mp4"/>
